			"notes": "## 中文\n\n- 可选择原版终末之诗相关曲目，或使用本地自定义背景音乐。\n- 自定义音乐支持 OGG/Vorbis、WAV 和 MP3，并会在播放结束后自动循环。\n- 配置界面新增“刷新”操作，可立即重新检测自定义音乐状态。\n- 新增终末之诗四边原版暗角的独立开关。\n\n## English\n\n- Choose a vanilla End Poem-related track or use local custom background music.\n- Custom music supports OGG/Vorbis, WAV, and MP3, and loops automatically after playback ends.\n- The configuration screen now includes Refresh to immediately recheck custom music status.\n- Added an independent toggle for the vanilla vignette around the End Poem screen."
		},
